    questionText: "Use integration by parts to obtain the first three terms of the asymptotic expansion, as \\( x\\to\\infty \\), of the exponential integral \\( \\displaystyle E_1(x)=\\int_x^{\\infty}\\frac{e^{-t}}{t}\\,dt \\).",
    marks: 4,
