    questionText: "The error function complement satisfies \\( \\operatorname{erfc}(x)=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\int_x^{\\infty}e^{-t^{2}}\\,dt \\). Using integration by parts, find the first two terms of its asymptotic expansion as \\( x\\to\\infty \\).",
