    questionText: "Give an explicit smooth \\( H:(0,\\infty)\\to(0,\\infty) \\) that admits an asymptotic power series \\( \\sum\\alpha_n x^{n} \\) as \\( x\\to 0^{+} \\) but for which term-by-term differentiation does NOT give an asymptotic series for \\( H' \\). Justify each claim.",
    marks: 5,
