      finalAnswer: "\\( H(x)=1+e^{-1/x}\\sin\\!\\big(e^{1/x}\\big) \\): \\( H\\sim 1 \\) but \\( H'(x)=x^{-2}e^{-1/x}\\sin(e^{1/x})-x^{-2}\\cos(e^{1/x}) \\) is unbounded and has no asymptotic power series.",
