    questionText: "For the Stieltjes integral \\( \\displaystyle G(x)=\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{e^{-t}}{(1+xt)^{2}}\\,dt \\sim \\sum_{n\\ge 0}(-1)^n(n+1)!\\,x^{n} \\), use optimal truncation at \\( x=0.1 \\) to estimate \\( G(0.1) \\), and compare with the exact value \\( 0.84366660602\\ldots \\).",
