    questionText: "Suppose \\( H'(x) \\) is continuous on \\( [0,\\infty) \\) with \\( H'(x)\\sim 4 + 6x + 3x^{2} + \\cdots \\) as \\( x\\to 0^{+} \\) and \\( H(0)=7 \\). Find the asymptotic series of \\( H \\) to order \\( x^{3} \\), and confirm that re-differentiating recovers the given series for \\( H' \\).",
